{"resourceIdentifier":"3851","resourceName":"Dongxing Waste Incineration Plant leachate biogas Harmless Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Dongxing Waste Incineration Plant leachate biogas Harmless Treatment and Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Dongxing Waste Incineration Plant, in Zhongmu County, Zhengzhou City, Henan Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Henan BCCY Environmental Energy Co., Ltd.in Zhongmu project City.\r\nBefore the implementation of this project, Zhengzhou (East) environmental Protection Energy Project invested by Zhengzhou Dongxing Environmental Protection Energy Co., Ltd. incinerates domestic waste with a daily treatment capacity of 4000t /d. Leachate will be produced during the storage and fermentation process in the garbage bin. The supporting treatment system of the factory is pretreatment +UASB+ secondary A/O-MBR aerobic system + nanofiltration NF+STRO treatment process. A large amount of biogas is produced in the anaerobic treatment section of UASB. This project collects the biogas generated by the anaerobic treatment section of leachate to generate electricity and connect to the grid, which can effectively utilize biogas resources.\r\nThe project started to construct on 30/11/2021 and started operation on 21/01/2022. The project has a total designed capacity 3MW (3*1MW) and combusts the leachate biogas, which contains nearly 65% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period will be 118,470MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated average GHG emission reductions of the project are 66,089tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 660,899tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":34.629716,"longitude":113.963177},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-29","endExclusive":"2022-12-30","endInclusive":"2022-12-29"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3851"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3851"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"66089"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.H."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21/08/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 21/01/2022 - 20/01/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=78496&IDKEY=oiofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3m108245984","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-dongxing.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-11-08T12:34:24.543Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=78495&IDKEY=uiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfm108244605","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Dongxing-VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-11-08T12:33:22.64Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","descriptio